Package: embryoIFquant
Type: Package
Title: Embryo-Level Quantification of Nuclear Immunofluorescence
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Khushi", "Singh", email = "khushisi175@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns per-nucleus intensity tables exported from Fiji (ROI Manager,
    Multi Measure) into embryo-level biological replicates and genotype effects.
    Nuclei are quality-controlled (saturation, area outliers), within-nucleus
    ratios are formed, nuclei are summarised to images and images to embryos,
    and each genotype is compared with a control by Welch t tests on log2 embryo
    values with Holm correction, checked by a mixed model. Independent imaging
    sessions are combined on a relative scale, never by pooling raw intensities.
    Superplots, forest plots and power calculations are included.
